        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Malacca</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 1396 CE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Founded</span><span class="info-stat-val">Founded by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/parameswara">Parameswara</a>, a Sumatran prince; 1396 is the year in which he announced the name Malaka, after a legend of a mouse deer and a tree.</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Where</span><span class="info-stat-val">On both sides of the Malacca River near its mouth on the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/strait-of-malacca">Strait of Malacca</a>, on the south-western coast of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/malay-peninsula">Malay Peninsula</a>, in Malaysia, about 152 km from <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kuala-lumpur">Kuala Lumpur</a>.</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Known for</span><span class="info-stat-val">The Malacca Sultanate and its <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/entrepot">entrepôt</a>; ties with Ming <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/china">China</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/zheng-he">Zheng He</a>; conquest by the Portuguese in 1511; the fortress <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/a-famosa">A Famosa</a>; the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dutch">Dutch</a> capture of 1641; the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/straits-settlements">Straits Settlements</a>; the Peranakan, Chitty and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kristang">Kristang</a> communities</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Today</span><span class="info-stat-val">Malacca City is the capital of the Malaysian state of Malacca, and its historic core, with George Town, was listed as a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/unesco-world-heritage-site">UNESCO World Heritage Site</a> in 2008.</span></div>
